{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/d8a9b2b32bbdb6aa025a5e1412e29ec4.poster.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/d8a9b2b32bbdb6aa025a5e1412e29ec4.webm?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/d8a9b2b32bbdb6aa025a5e1412e29ec4.mp4?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The deeper you go into the <strong>Haunted Swamp</strong>, the more you feel Witch Maeve\u2019s influence. <strong>She has bent the creatures here to her will</strong>, turning them into <strong>cursed abominations</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to break free, you\u2019ll have to defeat her first...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6d7ebc50ddf3c7ec7daee32163305565.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.poster.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.webm?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/c42d6c5ceee7960e165cdde3e6fa8d22.mp4?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Umigame</i>, you are a battle-hardened sea turtle on a perilous mission\u2014<strong>defeat the witch Maeve</strong> and free the Haunted Swamp from her curse. Fight through relentless enemies, adapt to ever-changing challenges, and grow stronger with every run in this fast-paced roguelite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/3883c6d79a59c2d63a0316b00837c2eb.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/581e09aa8cf990bec5da970b57ff87ae.poster.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/581e09aa8cf990bec5da970b57ff87ae.webm?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/581e09aa8cf990bec5da970b57ff87ae.mp4?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart, but the <strong>Omnicore</strong> may be the key to saving it. This mysterious artifact fuels your abilities, letting you <strong>awaken the power of nature</strong>\u2014causing mushrooms, totems, and creatures to rise up and protect the egg when placed on them. Its power is unstable\u2014how you harness it will define your survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/225675e16687e07070ec136f37423ffe.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.poster.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.webm?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/6a438eb28615621bd4bf9c8a0232ae0c.mp4?t=1761342250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omnicore &amp; Turrets :\u00a0</strong>Deploy and modify nature\u2019s guardians to shift the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unique Playable Characters :\u00a0</strong>Each with their own weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skills &amp; Items :\u00a0</strong>Stack absurd builds, experiment with upgrades, and break the game in the best way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>\u00a0: Every run brings new enemies, challenges, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online Co-op</strong>\u00a0: Team up with a friend and fight through the chaos together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/f1f1928965c6e7b15af253325542f156.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/99226ac4ac2999b1b9f20f8d990a61c1.poster.avif?t=1761342250\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/99226ac4ac2999b1b9f20f8d990a61c1.webm?t=1761342250\" type=\"vide